<!-- Merged by Tauri into the macOS app's Info.plist. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!-- An agent: no Dock icon, no menu bar of its own (the island and the menu bar icon are the app). -->
  <key>LSUIElement</key>
  <true/>
  <!-- Asked the first time Docky reads or controls Spotify or Music (the island's player), or asks the Finder to put a
       file from another disk in the Trash. -->
  <key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
  <string>O Docky mostra e controla a música do Spotify ou do Music, e manda para o Lixo os arquivos que você solta na ilha. / Docky shows and controls the music in Spotify or Music, and sends the files you drop on the island to the Trash.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
